                                "text": "1791, William Cowper (translator), The Odyssey of Homer, Book 7, lines 105-108, in The Iliad and Odyssey of Homer, London: J. Johnson, Volume 2, p. 151,\n[…] the doors were gold\nWhich shut the palace fast; silver the posts\nRear’d on a brazen threshold, and above,\nThe lintels, silver, architraved with gold."
